{"version":1,"content":"<p>經典射擊遊戲《毀滅戰士》（DOOM）再次迎來令人意想不到的新運行平台。德國嵌入式軟件開發者兼硬件黑客亞倫·克裏斯託費爾（Aaron Christophel）成功讓這款誕生於1993年的遊戲運行在一枚128GB USB閃存盤上，而玩家控制遊戲角色的方式同樣充滿創意：通過向U盤複製或讀取文件來完成移動、開火等操作。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586820.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:47.142231+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:32:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.217288+00:00","content_hash":"f92af9f5e7598720e8e1691886e78d4059b9c44119f661b456c4825181211d3b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}